# Stripe Configuration (Test Mode)
# Get your test publishable key from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_your_key_here

# Note: This is a frontend-only app with no backend
# The Stripe integration is currently in TEST MODE with mock payment processing
# To enable real Stripe payments, you would need:
# 1. A backend server to handle payment intents
# 2. Your Stripe test publishable key (starts with pk_test_)
# 3. Stripe.js library integration (already prepared in the code)

# For now, the app uses test card: 4242 4242 4242 4242
# Any future expiry date and any 3-digit CVC will work in test mode
